* The zeta series ` sum_ n ^c -u Z ` converges for complex ` Z ` with ` 1 < Re Z ` ( ~ zsercvg at ` Re Z ` and ~ abscvgcvg ).

s1::simpl |- ( ( Z e. CC /\ 1 < ( Re ` Z ) ) -> Z e. CC )
