s11:s5,s8,s10:syl2anc |- ( ( ( Z e. CC /\ 1 < ( Re ` Z ) ) /\ k e. NN ) -> ( ( n e. NN |-> ( n ^c -u ( Re ` Z ) ) ) ` k ) = ( k ^c -u ( Re ` Z ) ) )
s12::oveq1 |- ( n = k -> ( n ^c -u Z ) = ( k ^c -u Z ) )
